            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428900/extras/67b5baee41b3674d3e35197ac8f327e7.avif?t=1569104273\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br>The goal of the game is to survive for more than 60 seconds on each level, dodging platforms and objects, listening to bitpop soundtracks. Four levels, online-records, achievements and trading cards are waiting for you.<br><br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Challenging gameplay, aimed at reaction<br></li><li> Four unique levels, each with its difficulty, design and music<br></li><li> More than 20 achievements, 7 of them are hidden<br></li><li> Online leaderboards<br></li><li> Steam trading cards</li></ul>",
