                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "cute little game, there are 5 levels that you can beat in about 5-50 minutes.\n\npros:\n+ the movement feels rewarding to master\n+ second to last level is great\n+ the gameplay feels smooth and satisfying\n\ncons:\n- the player hitbox is a little too big\n- the obstacles' hitboxes are a little lazy on the last level\n- the music:\n- is pretty mediocre and gets annoying fast\n- doesn't have to do much with the level its on \n- game gets easier with it turned off \n\ndespite all the cons i still enjoyed the game quite a bit.\nwatch out for the annoying achievement: you have to start level one without a tutorial or you will have to beat the game all over again if you want to get all the achievements.",
